  "description": "Your calendar, world clocks, and meetings, all at a glance.\n\n      • Upcoming meetings with countdown timers right in your sill bar\n      • One-click join for Teams, Zoom, Google Meet, Webex, and Slack\n      • Get notified when it's time to leave for in-person meetings\n      • Full-screen or toast reminders so you never miss a meeting\n      • World clocks pinned to your sill bar with live times for any timezone\n      • Slide through timezones to see what time it is anywhere\n      • Supports Microsoft Outlook, Google Calendar, and Apple iCloud (CalDAV)\n\n      Stay on top of your schedule without switching windows.",
  "iconFile": "Assets/package.png",
